-15 01:10:46","2026-09-16 17:12:45",{"date":953,"timezone":258},"2026-09-04 20:33:22",[955,956,957,958,959,960,961,962],{"user_name":66,"vote":261},{"user_name":68,"vote":261},{"user_name":78,"vote":261},{"user_name":84,"vote":261},{"user_name":86,"vote":261},{"user_name":90,"vote":261},{"user_name":76,"vote":261},{"user_name":70,"vote":261},{"id":964,"type":127,"data":965},"HriNWiZ3zg",{"text":966,"level":147},"5g. Acceptance of Gift-in-Kind Donation from the Lake Land College Foundation",{"id":968,"type":150,"data":969},"iw3YpjK807",{"text":970},"Presented by: Jean Anne Highland, with supporting memo from Christi Donsbach, Executive Director of College Advancement, and Foundation donation certification form included in the Board Packet.",{"id":972,"type":150,"data":973},"1HAIoQjxc7",{"text":578},{"id":975,"type":195,"data":976},"ZitOZMDzRH",{"style":197,"items":977},[978,979,980,981,982,983,984],"Paul Koerner, owner of SDS Technology, donated an animated holiday light show display to the Lake Land College Foundation, which is being transferred to the college.","Display will be installed at the Effingham Technology Center; storage when not in use will be handled by the donor.","Display features holiday themes such as Santa Claus and reindeer themes (non-religious).","Educational tie-in: SDS staff will work with the College's Innovation Lab and STEM programming to teach students how to code and program the light show displays.","Estimated value: $15,000","Administration is still working to provide electricity to the grounds where the holiday display will be located during the holiday months.","Note from Board: Suggestion made to consider holding the December board meeting at ETC to view the display.",{"id":986,"type":205,"data":987},"8H-YGdTcNq",{"text":988,"linkedMotionId":989,"motionSnapshot":990,"parent":222,"child":222},"\u003Cp>Approve the acceptance of the animated holiday light show equipment valued at $15,000.00 from the Lake Land College Foundation to Lake Land College.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Moved by:\u003C/span> Scott Montgomery\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Seconded by:\u003C/span> Chuck Deters\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Outcome:\u003C/span> Carried\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Gary Cadwell (Yes), Chuck Deters (Yes), Scott Montgomery (Yes), Doris Reynolds (Yes), Denise Walk (Yes), Tom Wright (Yes), Larry Lilly (Yes), Wyatt Draper (Yes)\u003C/p>",8828,{"id":989,"motion_text":991,"decision":211,"notes":14,"moved_by_user":992,"seconded_by_user":995,"created_at":998,"votes":1000},"Approve the acceptance of the animated holiday light show equipment valued at $15,000.00 from the Lake Land College Foundation to Lake Land College.",{"id":242,"name":78,"email":243,"slug":244,"created_at":245,"updated_at":217,"first_name":246,"last_name":247,"two_factor_auth":44,"country_code":44,"phone":44,"hubspot_id":14,"locked_at":44,"image":14,"accepted_terms":220,"accepted_privacy_policy":221,"email_2fa":44,"saml_only":222,"saml_last_login_at":44,"accepted_cookie_policy":14,"email_confirmed":130,"confirmation_email_expires_at":223,"confirmation_email_token":14,"has_password":33,"url":248,"avatar_url":225,"summary":993,"profile":994},{"format":227,"first_name":246,"last_name":247,"email":243,"image":225,"name":78,"slug":244},{"id":251,"user_id":242,"organization_id":34,"title":14,"company":14,"contact_email":243,"contact_phone":252,"bio":14,"twitter":14,"facebook":14,"linkedin":14,"image":14,"additional_notifications_email":14,"created_at":245,"updated_at":253,"deleted_at":44,"meeting_reminder":130,"board_role":232,"personal_address":14,"personal_address_2":14,"personal_city":14,"personal_state":14,"personal_zip":14,"personal_phone":14,"onboard":222,"invitation_status":233,"timezone":234,"extra":14,"send_notifications":130,"last_activity":254,"introduced":222,"board_term_from":236,"board_term_to":237,"email_notification_frequency":238,"notifications_opened_at":255,"last_api_activity":44,"birthday":44,"is_guest":222,"api_user":222,"api_key":44,"language":239,"s